WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.710
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.980 --> 00:02.250
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

3
00:02.270 --> 00:03.520
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

4
00:03.540 --> 00:04.790
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

5
00:04.810 --> 00:06.060
viewer discretion is advised]

6
00:06.210 --> 00:08.390
Only evil blood

7
00:08.750 --> 00:11.480
will be sacrificed to the weapons you create.

8
00:12.110 --> 00:13.460
You must seek

9
00:13.480 --> 00:16.580
every material before sunset.

10
00:16.600 --> 00:20.080
If one day, death should bereave you of me,

11
00:20.100 --> 00:21.970
do enshrine this...

12
00:21.990 --> 00:23.890
death shall never...

13
00:23.910 --> 00:26.110
bereave me of my love for you.

14
00:26.610 --> 00:29.300
They are not to be made excessively.

15
00:30.040 --> 00:33.190
Use them only when you must.

16
00:38.600 --> 00:40.410
The might of the sacred materials

17
00:40.430 --> 00:42.410
within the consecrated bullets

18
00:42.750 --> 00:45.080
can break all curses

19
00:45.310 --> 00:47.890
and all invulnerability spells.

20
00:50.210 --> 00:52.800
I'm not worried about whether the bullets will work.

21
00:54.350 --> 00:56.420
The one thing on my mind

22
00:56.920 --> 00:57.800
is...

23
00:59.900 --> 01:02.520
I'm worried about you, Master.

24
01:05.220 --> 01:06.730
I'm sorry

25
01:07.110 --> 01:09.120
that you have to get hurt like that

26
01:09.140 --> 01:11.120
just to help me.

27
01:15.300 --> 01:17.020
Worry not about me, my dearest.

28
01:18.850 --> 01:20.510
Whether it be the worst karma

29
01:20.530 --> 01:21.840
or the greatest merit,

30
01:22.510 --> 01:25.300
I am bathed in joy to share it with you.

31
01:28.590 --> 01:29.590
Thank you.

32
01:30.410 --> 01:32.800
Whatever your reason

33
01:32.820 --> 01:34.830
for agreeing to help me,

34
01:36.510 --> 01:38.110
I truly thank you.

35
01:41.320 --> 01:43.510
There is one thing I must tell you.

36
01:44.900 --> 01:47.400
Even a hundred curses, piled high,

37
01:47.600 --> 01:50.410
shall never triumph over one drop of goodness.

38
01:52.820 --> 01:55.390
You are here not to rely on the bullets.

39
01:56.310 --> 01:57.970
The bullets, indeed,

40
01:57.990 --> 02:00.790
rely upon the virtues within your heart.

41
02:06.420 --> 02:08.780
Once all is fulfilled,

42
02:09.520 --> 02:11.900
are you to return to where you belong?

43
02:14.900 --> 02:16.510
I...

44
02:22.020 --> 02:23.020
Actually,

45
02:23.040 --> 02:24.930
I haven't thought about...

46
02:24.950 --> 02:26.680
what I would do

47
02:26.700 --> 02:28.120
once everything is over,

48
02:28.900 --> 02:31.500
whether I'll stay here as a cop in Phop Phra

49
02:31.530 --> 02:32.690
or...

50
02:34.120 --> 02:36.200
going back to work in Bangkok.

51
02:37.000 --> 02:39.480
Because the only goal I'm thinking about right now

52
02:39.500 --> 02:41.590
is to arrest Krating.

53
02:51.150 --> 02:51.900
Hey...

54
02:53.490 --> 02:55.820
You want me to stay here?

55
02:58.900 --> 03:01.310
I would never bind you to myself.

56
03:02.300 --> 03:04.800
I know you have matters to worry over

57
03:04.820 --> 03:06.850
and someone who awaits you.

58
03:08.320 --> 03:10.100
Just meeting my karmic soulmate

59
03:11.210 --> 03:13.600
and seeing her buoyant heart,

60
03:15.000 --> 03:17.010
my own heart is buoyant, too,

61
03:19.190 --> 03:21.410
no matter where you are.

62
03:28.020 --> 03:30.920
Have you espied something in me?

63
04:21.220 --> 04:23.070
Not many moons ago

64
04:23.090 --> 04:24.890
did we come to meet.

65
04:26.290 --> 04:28.920
From this day forth, whatever may happen,

66
04:30.590 --> 04:32.890
I shall linger by your side.

67
04:34.020 --> 04:35.470
Even when I am not there in flesh,

68
04:37.600 --> 04:39.580
I shall remain with my love.

69
05:25.000 --> 05:26.190
Thank you.

70
06:08.410 --> 06:12.810
♫Along with ghostly spirits hounding relentlessly,♫

71
06:12.830 --> 06:17.480
♫May the maras be ravaged and perish completely♫

72
06:17.500 --> 06:21.810
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

73
06:21.830 --> 06:26.130
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

74
06:26.150 --> 06:30.560
♫Were any souls to brush against my karmic soulmate,♫

75
06:30.580 --> 06:35.080
♫They shall bury the thought of returning to their realm♫

76
06:35.100 --> 06:39.190
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

77
06:39.210 --> 06:43.760
♫At my feet, they shall surrender and kneel,♫

78
06:43.780 --> 06:48.890
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

79
07:12.360 --> 07:14.360
I told you, you're not allowed inside.

80
07:14.380 --> 07:15.660
The master won't tattoo you.

81
07:15.680 --> 07:16.600
Go back!

82
07:16.920 --> 07:19.000
I said, I'm fucking going in, Auntie.

83
07:19.880 --> 07:21.240
Can you stay out of this?

84
07:21.600 --> 07:22.600
Are you the master?

85
07:22.850 --> 07:24.100
You're answering for her.

86
07:25.460 --> 07:27.120
Should you not be considerate of me,

87
07:30.500 --> 07:33.240
then be so for my sacred masters.

88
07:34.190 --> 07:35.610
Master, I already told these men

89
07:35.930 --> 07:38.320
that you don't tattoo men.

90
07:38.510 --> 07:40.400
They won't go no matter how hard I shoo them.

91
07:40.420 --> 07:42.560
They only want to go inside the sanctum.

92
07:44.290 --> 07:46.150
- Hi, Master. - Hi.

93
07:47.320 --> 07:48.320
So...

94
07:48.520 --> 07:50.690
we're not bad guys or anything.

95
07:51.000 --> 07:53.000
We might look rowdy on the outside,

96
07:53.020 --> 07:54.830
but we make an honest living.

97
07:55.210 --> 07:57.200
That's why I want you...

98
07:57.220 --> 07:58.580
to tattoo me.

99
07:58.610 --> 08:00.930
We're not gonna abuse it, Master.

100
08:00.960 --> 08:01.920
Rest assured.

101
08:02.600 --> 08:04.370
And why do you wish for one?

102
08:05.820 --> 08:07.300
Here's the thing, Master.

103
08:07.320 --> 08:09.400
The other day, Seua met this girl

104
08:09.420 --> 08:11.110
he's captivated by,

105
08:11.310 --> 08:12.790
so he wants you

106
08:13.010 --> 08:15.330
to tattoo a Heavenly Lotus yantra on him for the great charm.

107
08:15.350 --> 08:18.590
So he can get nice and settled down with a wife this year.

108
08:19.620 --> 08:21.400
That's right, Master.

109
08:22.720 --> 08:23.810
What's going on?

110
08:25.600 --> 08:27.100
Here comes my beautiful girl.

111
08:29.100 --> 08:30.750
Did you miss me, beautiful?

112
08:31.300 --> 08:32.600
What are you doing here?

113
08:32.940 --> 08:34.360
I'm here to see Master, beautiful.

114
08:35.250 --> 08:36.910
And what are you doing here?

115
08:39.240 --> 08:40.650
Are you two acquainted?

116
08:43.200 --> 08:44.670
I happened to meet him when...

117
08:44.690 --> 08:46.040
I was running some errands yesterday.

118
08:48.610 --> 08:50.440
Beautiful, you know Master?

119
08:51.870 --> 08:53.300
Then, beautiful,

120
08:53.320 --> 08:56.100
could you please ask her to give me a tattoo?

121
08:56.120 --> 08:57.540
I really need one.

122
08:58.320 --> 08:59.820
The needles in my sanctum

123
08:59.840 --> 09:01.290
do not meet the skin

124
09:01.860 --> 09:03.780
of those who practice the arts

125
09:03.800 --> 09:04.870
in bad faith.

126
09:04.900 --> 09:06.120
Master,

127
09:06.750 --> 09:08.350
you can just tattoo me.

128
09:09.100 --> 09:10.480
No need to tattoo him.

129
09:10.840 --> 09:12.320
She's not tattooing you.

130
09:12.620 --> 09:13.700
Leave,

131
09:14.720 --> 09:16.790
or you'll be trespassing.

132
09:17.530 --> 09:19.900
Are you a cop, beautiful?

133
09:20.710 --> 09:21.890
Gorgeous and fierce,

134
09:22.090 --> 09:23.440
that's totally my type.

135
09:24.110 --> 09:24.890
So...

136
09:25.180 --> 09:26.990
are you taken or not?

137
09:27.010 --> 09:28.400
I'll pamper you,

138
09:28.420 --> 09:30.570
protect you from all harm.

139
09:31.260 --> 09:32.370
I promise,

140
09:32.390 --> 09:35.300
I'll treasure you like a beautiful flower.

141
09:36.450 --> 09:38.160
- Whoa, whoa! - Ow, ow, ow, ow!

142
09:38.290 --> 09:39.570
Ow! That hurts!

143
09:39.590 --> 09:40.970
- Ma'am, please calm down. - This is police abuse!

144
09:41.240 --> 09:42.510
I can sue you!

145
09:43.320 --> 09:45.420
Extortion and contempt,

146
09:45.440 --> 09:47.230
causing harm to other individuals

147
09:47.330 --> 09:48.480
with the intent

148
09:48.500 --> 09:50.360
to defame.

149
09:50.470 --> 09:51.600
- How about that? - Ow, ow...

150
09:51.870 --> 09:53.280
- Are you gonna sue? - That hurts...

151
09:53.370 --> 09:54.420
Ow, ow, ow.

152
09:54.440 --> 09:56.170
Okay, okay, okay.

153
09:56.790 --> 09:57.790
I give up.

154
09:57.950 --> 09:59.240
I give up, beautiful

155
09:59.310 --> 10:00.730
I do. Please let go.

156
10:01.210 --> 10:02.210
Please.

157
10:06.440 --> 10:08.400
I still insist, Master.

158
10:08.700 --> 10:11.000
I'll pester you

159
10:11.020 --> 10:12.520
until you cave in.

160
10:13.520 --> 10:14.520
Then...

161
10:14.540 --> 10:15.820
I'm heading out.

162
10:16.600 --> 10:17.990
Bye-bye, beautiful.

163
10:20.480 --> 10:21.790
Don't miss me.

164
10:22.580 --> 10:23.310
Oud,

165
10:23.330 --> 10:24.400
head back now.

166
10:24.900 --> 10:25.590
Bye.

167
10:26.000 --> 10:27.320
You fell for the auntie?

168
10:27.580 --> 10:28.580
Standing there all stunned.

169
10:28.600 --> 10:29.920
No, man.

170
10:51.020 --> 10:52.020
What is it?

171
10:52.050 --> 10:54.200
Why have you come so early?

172
10:54.490 --> 10:56.010
For this year's Krua Tan Procession,

173
10:56.030 --> 10:58.820
will you set up an almshouse?

174
11:01.900 --> 11:02.800
Certainly.

175
11:02.820 --> 11:05.000
I shall leave it to you.

176
11:05.020 --> 11:06.990
Then, we will come up with the menu

177
11:07.010 --> 11:08.760
in advance.

178
11:14.170 --> 11:14.680
Sarge.

179
11:16.800 --> 11:17.510
Sarge!

180
11:21.610 --> 11:22.900
There's new information about Krating

181
11:22.920 --> 11:24.260
from our informant

182
11:24.410 --> 11:26.630
regarding the tattoo on his left chest.

183
11:27.120 --> 11:28.120
This tattoo

184
11:28.160 --> 11:29.500
is called a "Weretiger."

185
11:29.690 --> 11:31.520
It's a Lanna belief

186
11:31.840 --> 11:33.670
about those who possess sacred arts and,

187
11:33.690 --> 11:34.630
as they grow old,

188
11:34.650 --> 11:36.820
can no longer control them.

189
11:36.970 --> 11:38.760
They eventually shapeshift into tigers.

190
11:39.220 --> 11:40.790
It's similar to "Saming Tigers," Lieutenant.

191
11:41.390 --> 11:42.430
"Saming tigers" are...

192
11:42.450 --> 11:43.650
tigers that eat humans

193
11:44.020 --> 11:45.020
and become possessed by their spirits,

194
11:45.420 --> 11:46.670
thus able to shapeshift into humans.

195
11:47.240 --> 11:49.090
As for the Weretigers Inspector Chon said,

196
11:49.410 --> 11:50.920
they're humans able to shapeshift into tigers.

197
11:55.960 --> 11:58.100
And how is that relevant to Krating, Inspector?

198
11:58.720 --> 12:00.820
It's relevant because this Weretiger group

199
12:00.990 --> 12:03.760
holds sway across the borders of

200
12:03.780 --> 12:04.890
Thailand,

201
12:04.910 --> 12:06.550
Myanmar, and Karen State.

202
12:07.080 --> 12:08.610
They are an organized ring,

203
12:08.930 --> 12:11.430
exploiting loopholes in the laws of each area

204
12:11.460 --> 12:13.600
for arms trafficking, drug trafficking...

205
12:14.120 --> 12:15.120
and human trafficking...

206
12:16.230 --> 12:16.960
That's right.

207
12:17.300 --> 12:18.690
Cases of missing girls

208
12:18.710 --> 12:20.920
in our province over the years,

209
12:21.320 --> 12:23.090
I think it's likely their doing.

210
12:24.370 --> 12:25.320
They believe that

211
12:25.340 --> 12:27.170
engaging in sexual activity with virgin teenage girls

212
12:27.190 --> 12:28.950
will extend their lifespan,

213
12:28.970 --> 12:30.620
while also enhancing the strength

214
12:30.640 --> 12:32.360
of their arts.

215
12:33.010 --> 12:35.800
So what can we do right now, Inspector?

216
12:36.540 --> 12:37.910
Uh, please calm down, Lieutenant.

217
12:38.500 --> 12:39.710
Take a look at these numbers first.

218
12:40.620 --> 12:41.620
These are the numbers

219
12:41.650 --> 12:42.690
of missing-child cases

220
12:42.720 --> 12:44.230
in our province.

221
12:44.980 --> 12:46.400
One notable feature

222
12:46.650 --> 12:47.680
is the monthly bars

223
12:47.700 --> 12:49.410
when the province hosted festivities

224
12:49.430 --> 12:50.690
or merit-making ceremonies.

225
12:51.810 --> 12:52.990
They seize the opportunity

226
12:53.220 --> 12:55.230
when children are out at night

227
12:55.400 --> 12:57.200
without supervision.

228
12:57.510 --> 12:59.390
Krua Tan Procession is approaching, too.

229
13:00.910 --> 13:01.990
Krua Tan...

230
13:02.230 --> 13:03.520
It's an annual merit-making ceremony.

231
13:04.210 --> 13:05.450
There's a merit-making event during the day

232
13:05.470 --> 13:07.280
and a Krua Tan alms procession into the ordination hall.

233
13:07.770 --> 13:09.010
At night, there's a temple fair.

234
13:12.090 --> 13:13.000
Last year,

235
13:13.130 --> 13:15.290
18 missing-child cases were reported

236
13:15.310 --> 13:16.930
during this ceremony.

237
13:17.100 --> 13:18.370
To this day,

238
13:18.460 --> 13:20.320
we haven't found those children.

239
13:20.610 --> 13:22.790
From the report I've looked into,

240
13:22.810 --> 13:24.890
they're likely coming to this ceremony

241
13:24.910 --> 13:26.340
to find new victims.

242
13:27.020 --> 13:27.910
From the sound of it...

243
13:27.930 --> 13:29.110
my daughter Priew

244
13:29.910 --> 13:31.590
is likely to become a target.

245
13:33.710 --> 13:34.710
No,

246
13:34.730 --> 13:37.520
I won't let anyone fall victim to them again.

247
13:39.020 --> 13:40.060
Then, we have to work together

248
13:40.090 --> 13:42.080
to keep a close eye on them.

249
14:18.500 --> 14:19.500
Are you having a stomach cramp?

250
14:20.000 --> 14:21.000
Mm...

251
14:21.400 --> 14:23.170
I suppose my crimson tide is approaching.

252
14:34.310 --> 14:35.960
Is it bad?

253
14:37.460 --> 14:38.830
Not too bad.

254
14:38.870 --> 14:40.670
I am merely weary,

255
14:40.690 --> 14:42.110
and I had to close the sanctum,

256
14:42.140 --> 14:43.820
unable to perform any rituals.

257
14:48.010 --> 14:49.220
Why is that?

258
14:50.620 --> 14:51.460
For...

259
14:51.480 --> 14:53.460
blood is impurity.

260
14:53.480 --> 14:55.220
I am but a vessel

261
14:55.820 --> 14:57.860
that ought not touch

262
14:57.880 --> 14:59.590
any of the auspicious forms of magical arts.

263
15:07.520 --> 15:09.840
There are still so many things...

264
15:12.070 --> 15:13.910
I haven't learned about you.

265
15:27.500 --> 15:29.500
Do inquire anything you please, my dearest.

266
15:30.110 --> 15:32.000
I shall answer every question.

267
15:35.240 --> 15:36.380
Then...

268
15:36.910 --> 15:39.500
may I ask if...

269
15:42.920 --> 15:44.200
I can

270
15:44.800 --> 15:47.020
hug you tonight?

271
16:12.210 --> 16:14.090
Should you not mind,

272
16:14.700 --> 16:16.420
do embrace me

273
16:16.440 --> 16:17.700
however many times you desire.

274
16:37.020 --> 16:38.310
Anything more than that,

275
16:38.330 --> 16:39.380
I shall not oblige.

276
16:47.020 --> 16:49.490
I hold the Five Precepts paramount.

277
16:49.510 --> 16:51.290
As grand ceremonies approach,

278
16:51.310 --> 16:53.390
I abide by the Eight Precepts.

279
16:57.100 --> 16:59.290
So that means...

280
17:02.320 --> 17:04.700
today, you're...

281
17:04.740 --> 17:07.090
not preparing for any grand ceremony?

282
17:09.820 --> 17:11.580
That means...

283
17:18.620 --> 17:19.620
But...

284
17:21.510 --> 17:23.910
I should know to restrain myself,

285
17:24.290 --> 17:27.250
as well as my own desires and lust;

286
17:28.660 --> 17:30.900
otherwise, it would be an offense against my precepts,

287
17:31.390 --> 17:34.400
and you shall be hounded by karma.

288
17:47.060 --> 17:49.030
Weather the storm a little longer.

289
17:52.790 --> 17:55.200
Once my crimson tide ceases,

290
17:55.800 --> 17:57.230
be it day

291
17:57.250 --> 17:58.810
or night,

292
18:00.500 --> 18:02.310
I shall not halt you.

293
18:07.620 --> 18:08.620
Then...

294
18:11.210 --> 18:14.520
I will prove it to you, Master...

295
18:16.810 --> 18:19.120
that your beauty

296
18:20.490 --> 18:22.210
is ethereal,

297
18:22.640 --> 18:24.280
so, so ethereal

298
18:24.810 --> 18:26.210
that...

299
18:26.420 --> 18:28.600
I want to admire

300
18:31.610 --> 18:33.520
every inch,

301
18:35.690 --> 18:37.080
every part of you.

302
18:50.510 --> 18:51.510
What?

303
18:51.680 --> 18:53.120
You said it yourself

304
18:53.210 --> 18:54.390
that I could embrace you.

305
18:55.010 --> 18:56.600
Yet your nose took the lead.

306
18:57.280 --> 18:58.160
Well...

307
18:58.210 --> 18:59.370
Can't I hug you...

308
18:59.400 --> 19:01.110
and sniff-kiss you?

309
19:05.000 --> 19:07.460
Who on earth could smell this good?

310
19:07.500 --> 19:09.090
You smell just like flowers.

311
19:33.810 --> 19:35.090
Over there

312
19:35.130 --> 19:37.040
is the area for the stalls at the ceremony.

313
19:37.300 --> 19:39.100
Your almshouse

314
19:40.010 --> 19:41.010
will be here,

315
19:41.030 --> 19:42.790
near the red hall.

316
19:43.310 --> 19:44.310
Also...

317
19:45.290 --> 19:47.090
it's located near electricity

318
19:47.110 --> 19:48.390
and plumbing.

319
19:49.210 --> 19:51.000
That way, it will be convenient to use.

320
19:51.110 --> 19:52.110
The Venerable Uncle

321
19:52.130 --> 19:53.780
decided that

322
19:53.800 --> 19:56.220
the festival grounds would be smaller this year,

323
19:56.260 --> 19:57.540
so the area for your almshouse

324
19:57.710 --> 19:59.720
will also be reduced.

325
19:59.900 --> 20:02.000
You do not mind, do you, Master?

326
20:02.800 --> 20:04.790
I intend to give alms.

327
20:04.900 --> 20:06.600
Be it small or grand,

328
20:06.710 --> 20:08.810
as the Venerable sees fit.

329
20:09.280 --> 20:10.620
Once you finish with the almshouse,

330
20:11.110 --> 20:12.300
I would like to trouble you

331
20:12.410 --> 20:14.920
with handing out flowers, incense sticks, and candles

332
20:14.970 --> 20:17.270
to those who come to pay respects

333
20:17.290 --> 20:18.690
to the Buddha images in the ordination hall.

334
20:27.200 --> 20:28.500
Was the bullet forging

335
20:28.520 --> 20:30.400
a success?

336
20:31.620 --> 20:33.300
It was a success.

337
20:34.000 --> 20:35.810
Thank you, Master,

338
20:35.870 --> 20:37.960
for sacrificing your fabled iron for the lieutenant.

339
20:38.410 --> 20:40.290
Please do not call me so.

340
20:40.400 --> 20:42.020
I have retired from being a master.

341
20:42.700 --> 20:44.320
As for the fabled iron,

342
20:45.110 --> 20:47.000
it will be of no use in my hands.

343
20:47.220 --> 20:49.620
I had better hand it to those in need.

344
20:53.870 --> 20:55.520
I am happy for you

345
20:55.810 --> 20:57.400
that you two finally met.

346
20:57.510 --> 20:59.010
I believed she was the one,

347
20:59.190 --> 21:01.800
wholeheartedly, from the moment I first saw her.

348
21:02.300 --> 21:04.280
Her charm of metta

349
21:04.380 --> 21:05.900
is as exquisite as the treatise stated.

350
21:05.950 --> 21:07.080
No wonder...

351
21:07.890 --> 21:09.980
she is Master Bulan's karmic soulmate.

352
21:12.440 --> 21:14.220
Oh, Master.

353
21:14.440 --> 21:15.290
You're here, too?

354
21:15.310 --> 21:16.310
Seua!

355
21:17.450 --> 21:18.060
Yes, Dad?

356
21:18.080 --> 21:19.970
How could you greet her like that?

357
21:21.200 --> 21:22.300
Do not let me find out

358
21:23.000 --> 21:24.820
that you bother her,

359
21:25.530 --> 21:26.840
or your pate will be split in half!

360
21:27.490 --> 21:28.970
Jeez, Dad.

361
21:29.300 --> 21:30.620
We know each other here.

362
21:31.110 --> 21:32.790
Why do you have to be so harsh?

363
21:33.450 --> 21:34.770
Can you...

364
21:34.800 --> 21:35.970
talk to her

365
21:35.990 --> 21:37.020
and ask her

366
21:37.040 --> 21:39.010
to give me a Heavenly Lotus yantra tattoo?

367
21:40.500 --> 21:41.500
Please, Dad.

368
21:41.700 --> 21:43.500
You might just get a daughter-in-law

369
21:43.590 --> 21:44.710
- or even grandchildren. - Seua!

370
21:44.770 --> 21:45.530
Let us go.

371
21:46.480 --> 21:48.030
- Don't you want grandchildren? - What are you saying?

372
21:48.050 --> 21:48.970
Please, Dad.

373
21:48.990 --> 21:50.480
Have a word with her for me.

374
21:52.730 --> 21:55.080
[Phop Phra Police Station]

375
21:57.800 --> 21:59.010
Hello, Sarge.

376
21:59.860 --> 22:00.400
Hello.

377
22:14.620 --> 22:15.360
Sarge?

378
22:15.380 --> 22:15.990
Yes?

379
22:16.010 --> 22:16.890
Did you...

380
22:16.910 --> 22:19.030
smoke a cigarette at my desk?

381
22:19.800 --> 22:20.800
I didn't!

382
22:51.790 --> 22:52.530
Lieutenant!

383
22:53.320 --> 22:54.320
Lieutenant!

384
23:03.520 --> 23:04.520
Lieutenant!

385
23:15.890 --> 23:16.620
Lieutenant!

386
23:23.120 --> 23:23.700
Sarge!

387
23:23.750 --> 23:24.290
Get the car!

388
23:24.330 --> 23:25.190
Yes, ma'am!

389
23:26.230 --> 23:27.600
A double-cab pickup truck.

390
23:27.630 --> 23:29.560
GT1326, Tak Province.

391
23:29.610 --> 23:31.540
GT1326, Tak Province.

392
23:32.440 --> 23:33.440
Attention all highway units.

393
23:34.020 --> 23:35.190
Attention all highway units.

394
23:35.480 --> 23:37.270
This is the investigation unit of Phop Phra Police Station.

395
23:37.490 --> 23:38.890
Coordinate an interception immediately.

396
23:39.020 --> 23:41.150
Gray pickup truck,

397
23:41.170 --> 23:42.320
plate number...

398
23:42.340 --> 23:44.450
GT1326, Tak Province.

399
23:44.470 --> 23:46.520
GT1326, Tak Province.

400
23:46.800 --> 23:48.510
A suspect in a human trafficking case

401
23:48.530 --> 23:50.600
has been spotted fleeing Phop Phra,

402
23:50.660 --> 23:53.400
heading toward Highway 1090.

403
23:54.790 --> 23:55.480
Sarge,

404
23:55.500 --> 23:56.340
can you drive faster?

405
23:56.360 --> 23:57.100
Yes, ma'am.

406
24:07.070 --> 24:07.840
Sarge, check the vehicle.

407
24:07.970 --> 24:08.580
Yes.

408
24:16.310 --> 24:17.160
All clear, Sarge?

409
24:17.180 --> 24:17.810
All clear.

410
24:19.580 --> 24:21.040
Thank you, Inspector, for joining us.

411
24:21.310 --> 24:22.120
Right.

412
24:22.690 --> 24:23.850
This is the vehicle.

413
24:23.870 --> 24:25.120
It belongs to Krating.

414
24:25.140 --> 24:26.490
I think we should charge right in.

415
24:26.680 --> 24:27.680
- Let's move. - Hold on, Lieutenant.

416
24:27.700 --> 24:28.980
This is a private property.

417
24:29.000 --> 24:30.360
A search warrant is required.

418
24:30.710 --> 24:33.070
Without one, troubles will find their way to us.

419
24:33.250 --> 24:34.130
If we wait for the warrant,

420
24:34.150 --> 24:36.500
we'll never get to arrest the guy.

421
24:37.240 --> 24:38.110
What's your call, Lieutenant?

422
24:45.030 --> 24:45.600
Here's the plan.

423
24:49.190 --> 24:50.570
Split into two teams.

424
24:50.590 --> 24:52.400
My team and I will storm the front.

425
24:52.630 --> 24:53.890
Lieutenant and Sarge, go around the compound.

426
24:53.910 --> 24:55.380
We will trap them

427
24:55.400 --> 24:56.790
and charge in all at once.

428
25:02.400 --> 25:03.540
Sarge, ready?

429
25:08.700 --> 25:09.460
Freeze!

430
25:12.730 --> 25:13.670
Drop your weapon!

431
25:20.700 --> 25:21.900
Hands in the air!

432
25:34.790 --> 25:35.520
Hey!

433
25:35.620 --> 25:36.240
Halt!

434
25:36.770 --> 25:37.490
Freeze!

435
26:09.040 --> 26:09.490
Lieutenant.

436
26:09.510 --> 26:10.370
Inspector.

437
26:10.390 --> 26:11.380
Lieutenant, take it easy.

438
26:16.300 --> 26:17.300
Stay right there, Lieutenant!

439
26:18.510 --> 26:19.500
Inspector.

440
26:23.390 --> 26:24.390
Inspector.

441
26:39.590 --> 26:41.290
This way, Master.

442
26:41.390 --> 26:42.900
I'll drive you to the sanctum.

443
26:46.240 --> 26:47.200
There is no need.

444
26:47.220 --> 26:48.400
I shall handle it myself.

445
26:58.200 --> 26:59.240
What do you intend to do?

446
27:00.300 --> 27:01.380
My apologies, Master.

447
27:02.010 --> 27:03.280
Uh, I...

448
27:03.300 --> 27:04.200
I simply...

449
27:04.230 --> 27:05.950
want you to change your mind.

450
27:07.840 --> 27:08.880
I promise you

451
27:08.900 --> 27:10.110
I'll be on my best behavior

452
27:10.130 --> 27:11.810
and won't cross any moral lines.

453
27:12.400 --> 27:13.380
Master, I beg you...

454
27:13.400 --> 27:15.800
tattoo the Heavenly Lotus yantra on me.

455
27:16.510 --> 27:17.710
Fine words,

456
27:17.820 --> 27:19.390
though anyone can speak in such manner.

457
27:19.450 --> 27:20.710
The rules are absolute.

458
27:20.920 --> 27:22.420
No means no.

459
27:22.580 --> 27:23.670
What kind of man are you

460
27:23.800 --> 27:25.280
if you cannot even heed simple words?

461
27:26.110 --> 27:27.300
What's the big deal?

462
27:27.320 --> 27:28.690
It's just a tattoo, isn't it?

463
27:28.710 --> 27:30.830
All forms of magical arts are not mine,

464
27:30.850 --> 27:33.200
nor will I hoard them for myself.

465
27:33.720 --> 27:35.670
Should you wish to sway me with your charm and pity,

466
27:35.990 --> 27:38.210
then mend your foul ways

467
27:38.360 --> 27:40.310
before your own greed

468
27:41.030 --> 27:42.620
drags your life to ruin.

469
27:44.320 --> 27:45.800
I'd like to apologize to you, Master.

470
27:47.620 --> 27:50.220
I have no intention of speaking ill of you.

471
27:51.520 --> 27:52.720
I was simply curious to find out

472
27:52.740 --> 27:54.480
how powerful

473
27:54.500 --> 27:55.750
your magical arts were.

474
27:56.410 --> 27:58.620
No need to take it so seriously, right?

475
28:02.930 --> 28:04.770
Words become your master.

476
28:05.300 --> 28:06.910
Once spoken,

477
28:06.930 --> 28:08.900
you may never have the chance to undo them.

478
28:09.980 --> 28:10.980
If your mouth

479
28:11.000 --> 28:12.980
serves no useful purpose,

480
28:13.230 --> 28:14.520
keep it shut

481
28:14.710 --> 28:16.500
and let it rot with the rest of your body.

482
28:17.780 --> 28:19.250
Out of respect for your father,

483
28:19.480 --> 28:21.700
I offer this final warning:

484
28:22.200 --> 28:24.210
cease your foolish meddling,

485
28:24.410 --> 28:25.300
or your own tongue

486
28:25.320 --> 28:27.210
will bring about your demise.

487
28:29.900 --> 28:32.530
I'm sorry on Seua's behalf, Master.

488
28:33.200 --> 28:35.870
He just really wants to get the yantra tattooed on him.

489
28:37.300 --> 28:38.690
Let's go, Seua.

490
28:39.900 --> 28:40.900
She's mad for real.

491
28:49.340 --> 28:58.400
(Incanting)

492
29:03.260 --> 29:07.150
(Incanting)

493
29:14.750 --> 29:17.740
(Incanting)

494
29:28.190 --> 29:33.230
(Incanting)

495
29:36.020 --> 29:38.210
How did this team end up in this state?

496
29:39.740 --> 29:40.970
They're under a yantra's influence,

497
29:41.080 --> 29:42.080
so they've lost control.

498
29:42.500 --> 29:44.420
That's why they're mimicking the creature on the tattoo.

499
29:45.150 --> 29:46.150
That's why they're acting like

500
29:46.240 --> 29:47.240
the creature on one.

501
29:47.470 --> 29:48.140
But none of the officers

502
29:48.160 --> 29:50.750
have tattoos like Krating and his men, correct?

503
29:50.800 --> 29:51.450
You're absolutely right.

504
29:52.030 --> 29:53.790
But Inspector Chon has a tiger yantra.

505
29:54.420 --> 29:55.650
It usually grants the wearer

506
29:55.920 --> 29:57.030
power

507
29:57.130 --> 29:58.400
and protection.

508
29:59.110 --> 29:59.850
Still...

509
29:59.870 --> 30:01.670
I don't know why they end up like this!

510
30:04.500 --> 30:12.330
(Incanting)

511
30:15.840 --> 30:22.790
(Incanting)

512
30:35.010 --> 30:39.390
(Incanting)

513
31:06.910 --> 31:07.910
What is the matter?

514
31:08.160 --> 31:10.880
Mom is in danger.

515
31:26.690 --> 31:27.420
Hey!

516
31:32.200 --> 31:32.900
Go, Lieutenant!

517
31:41.020 --> 31:41.900
Are you alright?

518
31:42.610 --> 31:43.770
I'm fine, Sarge.

519
31:44.690 --> 31:45.870
What about you?

520
31:45.890 --> 31:46.800
Are you alright?

521
31:46.820 --> 31:47.760
I'm good.

522
31:50.510 --> 31:51.400
Here's the plan.

523
31:51.800 --> 31:53.130
I'll lure them to that side.

524
31:53.630 --> 31:54.870
I want you to

525
31:54.890 --> 31:56.010
call for backup,

526
31:56.900 --> 31:57.600
okay, Lieutenant?

527
32:00.750 --> 32:01.900
Can't wait to be eaten!

528
32:12.300 --> 32:14.180
It has been so long,

529
32:14.200 --> 32:15.770
Beautiful Lieutenant.

530
32:30.220 --> 32:32.130
These nine enchanted rounds

531
32:32.170 --> 32:33.690
took much to craft,

532
32:33.730 --> 32:35.110
as you may have witnessed.

533
32:36.010 --> 32:37.610
Mind how you spend them.

534
33:10.800 --> 33:11.670
Thong,

535
33:11.690 --> 33:12.730
go help your mom.

536
33:12.750 --> 33:14.200
I shall follow shortly.

537
33:37.680 --> 33:38.800
Seua!

538
33:39.300 --> 33:40.410
- Master! - Seua!

539
33:41.730 --> 33:42.500
- Damn it, Seua! - Seua!

540
33:42.520 --> 33:43.130
Dad, help me.

541
33:43.160 --> 33:44.010
Seua!

542
33:44.280 --> 33:45.200
- Don't you dare! - Seua, come on!

543
33:46.600 --> 33:47.600
Seua!

544
33:48.500 --> 33:49.420
Seua.

545
33:55.110 --> 34:06.720
(Incanting)

546
34:23.650 --> 34:24.730
- Seua! - Hey!

547
34:25.400 --> 34:26.130
Seua!

548
34:27.770 --> 34:28.830
- Hey, Seua. - Seua!

549
34:29.990 --> 34:30.750
Hey.

550
34:30.800 --> 34:31.630
Seua.

551
34:32.130 --> 34:33.190
- Damn it, Seua! - Seua.

552
34:34.330 --> 34:35.720
Thank you, Master.

553
34:36.500 --> 34:37.330
Seua!

554
34:37.900 --> 34:38.900
Let it be.

555
34:39.060 --> 34:40.790
Every ceremony faces its obstacles.

556
34:41.260 --> 34:42.840
Let us speak no further,

557
34:42.870 --> 34:44.320
or else we may startle the villagers.

558
34:45.200 --> 34:46.440
Understood, Master.

559
34:46.900 --> 34:48.490
I shall take care of him myself.

560
34:48.800 --> 34:49.590
Seua!

561
34:51.220 --> 34:52.530
- Seua! - Hey.

562
34:54.530 --> 34:55.600
What happened, Dad?

563
34:56.310 --> 34:57.310
Why are you two holding me?

564
34:58.440 --> 35:00.010
You recall nothing,

565
35:00.200 --> 35:00.810
huh?

566
35:02.220 --> 35:03.070
What are you talking about?

567
35:03.100 --> 35:05.030
You had no clue at all?

568
35:07.740 --> 35:09.200
Do you realize what you've done?

569
35:26.410 --> 35:28.300
Pray, pardon me, Venerable Father.

570
35:28.810 --> 35:30.080
If your intention

571
35:30.100 --> 35:32.310
is for the sake of others,

572
35:32.410 --> 35:34.690
then I shall allow it.

573
35:55.320 --> 35:56.100
Hey.

574
36:00.180 --> 36:01.220
Beautiful.

575
36:05.120 --> 36:07.880
What kind of cop misses their shot, Officer?

576
36:08.220 --> 36:09.040
Bastard!

577
36:17.100 --> 36:17.990
Stop!

578
36:21.820 --> 36:24.590
What kind of cop misses their shot, Officer?

579
36:43.300 --> 36:44.690
This is Thong.

580
36:45.110 --> 36:47.290
Do not fall for an illusion, Mom.

581
36:47.320 --> 36:49.020
Compose yourself.

582
36:52.210 --> 36:53.210
Thong...

583
37:19.390 --> 37:21.410
Mom, follow me this way.

584
37:36.290 --> 37:37.800
I'm right here, Officer.

585
37:47.000 --> 37:48.290
Beautiful.

586
38:08.200 --> 38:09.600
Here, I worship

587
38:09.620 --> 38:10.900
Goddess Vasundhara.

588
38:11.300 --> 38:12.870
May your virtue

589
38:13.220 --> 38:16.720
cleanse the taint of forbidden arts and lay it to ruin.

590
38:16.900 --> 38:18.500
May you keep

591
38:18.520 --> 38:20.880
Police Lieutenant Phitcha Ruechakun

592
38:20.900 --> 38:22.970
and those with meritorious hearts

593
38:23.010 --> 38:24.790
safe from all harm.

594
38:39.990 --> 38:41.570
Me sammukha

595
38:41.590 --> 38:42.590
sappaha rati,

596
38:42.610 --> 38:43.850
te sammukha.

597
38:43.870 --> 38:45.690
May the spawns of asuras perish

598
38:45.890 --> 38:47.560
by the hands of my sacred masters.

599
39:47.910 --> 39:49.290
See you again,

600
39:49.910 --> 39:51.510
Beautiful Lieutenant.

601
39:58.290 --> 39:59.750
Inspector...

602
40:07.100 --> 40:08.100
Inspector!

603
40:10.910 --> 40:11.910
Inspector!

604
40:12.170 --> 40:12.670
Inspector!

605
40:17.120 --> 40:17.910
Inspector!

606
40:27.120 --> 40:28.950
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

607
40:32.110 --> 40:33.700
What do you know about Krating?

608
40:40.310 --> 40:42.270
I admit I know that guy,

609
40:42.290 --> 40:43.150
but...

610
40:43.170 --> 40:44.590
he's just...

611
40:44.610 --> 40:46.920
a drinking buddy from back when I used to drink over there.

612
40:47.330 --> 40:48.330
Hey...

613
40:48.360 --> 40:50.080
But I never knew he was involved in human trafficking

614
40:50.100 --> 40:50.810
and all that.

615
40:50.830 --> 40:52.290
I know nothing about him.

616
40:52.700 --> 40:54.190
I haven't contacted him for years now.

617
41:24.920 --> 41:26.230
I am not the only soul

618
41:26.600 --> 41:28.380
to assist you.

619
41:36.810 --> 41:39.090
He deem me his mother,

620
41:40.900 --> 41:43.090
and himself my son.

621
41:46.510 --> 41:47.510
Thong.

622
41:51.210 --> 41:52.210
Thong.

623
41:55.510 --> 41:57.400
I bought you a toy

624
41:58.400 --> 42:00.380
as a way to say thank you.

625
42:01.600 --> 42:02.700
Thanks, Thong.

626
42:26.700 --> 42:27.700
Thong,

627
42:29.620 --> 42:31.600
Mom bought you a toy.

628
42:32.030 --> 42:33.310
Come out and see me.

629
42:35.990 --> 42:36.720
Thong.

630
43:11.710 --> 43:13.470
It is me, Thong.

631
43:13.910 --> 43:14.910
Thong.

632
43:16.220 --> 43:17.130
Here.

633
43:17.150 --> 43:19.290
I bought you a toy.

634
43:20.490 --> 43:21.380
Do you like it?

635
43:21.700 --> 43:22.700
Come here.

636
43:24.410 --> 43:26.400
Alright. Three, two...

637
43:28.290 --> 43:29.200
Do you like it?

638
43:29.310 --> 43:30.220
I do.

639
43:31.110 --> 43:32.500
Thank you.

640
43:32.520 --> 43:33.410
Mm.

641
43:33.620 --> 43:34.990
I must also thank you

642
43:35.300 --> 43:37.610
for lending me your aid.

643
43:44.720 --> 43:46.430
The ceremony is fast approaching.

644
43:46.620 --> 43:48.530
I shall tailor a set from these fabrics

645
43:48.550 --> 43:50.440
for you to wear at the ceremony.

646
43:51.300 --> 43:52.790
Oh.

647
43:53.110 --> 43:54.190
And...

648
43:55.300 --> 43:56.690
As for these fabrics,

649
43:56.720 --> 43:58.410
where did you get them?

650
43:58.810 --> 44:00.540
From my disciples,

651
44:00.560 --> 44:03.320
and at times, from those I have helped in their hour of need.

652
44:03.500 --> 44:05.180
Since I never take payment,

653
44:05.260 --> 44:07.210
they offered them as tokens of gratitude.

654
44:09.520 --> 44:12.740
Then I should offer you a token of gratitude,

655
44:13.340 --> 44:14.490
since...

656
44:14.710 --> 44:16.830
you also helped me.

657
44:17.610 --> 44:19.730
What would that be, may I ask?

658
44:31.100 --> 44:33.570
I've never asked you

659
44:33.630 --> 44:36.010
what these yantras do.

660
44:37.800 --> 44:39.510
The Sacred Chain yantra

661
44:39.720 --> 44:42.190
envelopes its bearer in divine favor.

662
44:45.900 --> 44:47.390
The Sacred Crystal Wall yantra

663
44:48.080 --> 44:50.750
forms a sacred barrier that wards off all peril,

664
44:51.110 --> 44:54.120
much like the Eight-Directional yantra inked across my back.

665
44:58.300 --> 44:59.940
What about this area?

666
45:02.710 --> 45:04.600
The Twin Bird and Lotus yantra

667
45:05.610 --> 45:08.200
bestows the gift of enchantment upon one's speech.

668
45:11.330 --> 45:12.900
What about

669
45:17.360 --> 45:19.000
the Heavenly Lotus yantra...

670
45:19.410 --> 45:21.800
that everyone is after?

671
45:23.340 --> 45:24.810
The Heavenly Lotus yantra...

672
45:25.030 --> 45:26.790
A supreme yantra of great charm.

673
