678
47:51.510 --> 47:52.290
Thong.

679
47:54.310 --> 47:55.590
Leave for now.

680
47:57.090 --> 48:00.500
Mom has something important to discuss with your mommy

681
48:01.610 --> 48:03.210
all night.

682
48:04.420 --> 48:06.310
And I will not be stopping either.

683
50:13.340 --> 50:14.340
My dearest.

684
50:15.800 --> 50:18.010
