693
52:10.020 --> 52:11.020
sweet watermelons.

694
52:11.100 --> 52:12.010
She is.

695
52:12.220 --> 52:13.290
Absolutely, she is.

696
52:13.840 --> 52:15.380
You awaken the feelings

697
52:15.400 --> 52:16.760
